                     <title source="251">J. de Mirfield, etc.</title>
                  <title source="4278">Breviarium Bartholomei; J. de Mirfeld; etc.</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes" source="4278">Medieval binding with five bosses on each
                        cover, two nails for clasps in centre of 2nd cover, 2 straps and metal
                        plates to attach to the nails.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes" source="4278">R. Bartlett was fellow at All Souls 1495; died
                        1556; he was president of the Royal College of Physicians.</note>
                  </msItem>
